#: ../../source/workflows/study-recruitment.rst:2
msgid "Recruitment of participants for a study"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/workflows/study-recruitment.rst:4
msgid "Log in to Castellum by using your username and password"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/workflows/study-recruitment.rst:5
msgid ""
"Click on **Recruitment** 2.1 If you see the message **There are currently"
" no studies you can recruit for**, please follow instruction 2.2. If you "
"see the relevant study, go to step 3. 2.2 Contact the responsible person "
"who has access to the role distribution of the study you wish to recruit "
"for"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/workflows/study-recruitment.rst:12
msgid ""
"Wäre es sinnvoll, an dieser Stelle einen Button*\\ **Zugriffsanfrage**\\ "
"*o.ä. einzubauen? So könnte eine Zugriffsanfrage zur Studie direkt an "
"den/die Verantwortliche/n gesendet werden."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/workflows/study-recruitment.rst:17
msgid ""
"Click on **Find subjects** next to the study you want to recruit "
"participants for"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/workflows/study-recruitment.rst:19
msgid "By clicking on **Add**, relevant probands will be shown to you"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/workflows/study-recruitment.rst:20
msgid "Press the **Call** button to contact the person you want to reach"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/workflows/study-recruitment.rst:22
msgid ""
"**E-Mail address**, **Phone number**, a potential **Phone number "
"alternative** and the **Address** will be shown to you"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/workflows/study-recruitment.rst:24
msgid ""
"You might also see the **Preferred contact method**, if the person is "
"**currently available** and some **General recruiting notes**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/workflows/study-recruitment.rst:26
msgid ""
"Please have a look at the **Talking points** that the study coordinator "
"has defined"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/workflows/study-recruitment.rst:30
msgid ""
"Organisatorischer Punkt: was genau soll der Studienanleger hier "
"beschreiben? Studienablauf, Abfrage von wichtigen Attributen und/oder "
"Anwendung von Methoden in der Studie?"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/workflows/study-recruitment.rst:34
msgid "CALL/CONTACT"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/workflows/study-recruitment.rst:36
msgid "Kann man direkt in Castellum die Personen anrufen?"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/workflows/study-recruitment.rst:38
msgid "Select a **Status of participation request**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/workflows/study-recruitment.rst:40
msgid "Choose between:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/workflows/study-recruitment.rst:42
msgid "**Not reached**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/workflows/study-recruitment.rst:43
msgid "**Unsuitable**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/workflows/study-recruitment.rst:45
msgid ""
"This may apply if attributes of the person do not comply with the "
"requirements of the study"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/workflows/study-recruitment.rst:48
msgid "**Invited** or"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/workflows/study-recruitment.rst:49
msgid "**Recall appointed**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/workflows/study-recruitment.rst:51
msgid "Determine the date and time of the recall appointment"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/workflows/study-recruitment.rst:53
msgid ""
"When you select the **Status of participant request** and click on **Save"
" and show next**, the next contact person will be shown to you "
"automatically"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/workflows/study-recruitment.rst:58
msgid "Editing contact data and attributes; adding probands to the study"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/workflows/study-recruitment.rst:61
msgid ""
"*Mit*\\ **Edit subject**\\ *ist doch gemeint, dass die Person als "
"Proband/-in zur Studie hinzugefügt und eingeladen wird, richtig? Aus "
"Verständlichkeitsgründen lieber*\\ **Edit subject to study**\\ "
"*schreiben?*"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/workflows/study-recruitment.rst:66
msgid ""
"\\* Click on **Edit contact data** in order to do so and press **Save** "
"\\* By clicking **Edit attributes**, you can change characteristics of "
"the person that became known in the conversation \\* When you press "
"**Edit subject**, you can \\* Determine the **Privacy level** \\* Settle "
"the time-based **Availability** of the person \\* Press **Save** to "
"record the progress"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/workflows/study-recruitment.rst:74
msgid ""
"**Hard of hearing**\\ *bei*\\ **Notes**\\ *bedeutet doch*\\ "
"**schwerhörig**\\ *, richtig? Dass die Person schwer zu verstehen ist "
"oder sie ausfällig spricht, passt in meinen Augen nicht dazu. Sollte der "
"erste Stichpunkt abgeändert werden oder habt ihr das aus einem bestimmten"
" Grund so geschrieben?*"
msgstr ""

